re":{"scale":100,"source":"anilist","value":75},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2017,"series":["al-98222"],"seriesIds":[98222],"startDate":{"day":15,"month":4,"year":2017},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":73,"name":"TMS Entertainment"},{"animation":false,"id":236,"name":"YTV"},{"animation":false,"id":62,"name":"Shogakukan-Shueisha Productions"},{"animation":false,"id":467,"name":"Discotek"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"A bombing case at Nichiuri TV in autumn. The Satsuki Cup, which crowns the winner of Japan's Ogura Hyakunin Isshu based competitive karuta tournament, is currently being filmed inside the facility. The incident results in a big commotion and, while the building is burning to ashes, the only people left inside are Heiji and Kazuha. They get rescued just in time by Conan, who rushes to the scene. Both the identity and motive of the bomber are unknown.\n\nWhile confusion takes over due to the explosion, Conan meets a mysterious beautiful girl who claims she is \"Heiji's fiancée\". Her name is Momiji Ooka and she is the Kyoto High School karuta champion. As fate would have it, Kazuha is going to face Momiji in the Hyakunin Isshu competition, so she begins to train with the help of Heiji's mother, Shizuka, who is a skilled karuta player.\n\nAt the same time, in a Japanese house in Arashiyama, Kyoto's outskirts, the reigning Satsuki Cup champion is murdered. Pictures of the crime scene reveal Momji's presence. Additionally, several karuta cards were spread around the victim.\n\nConan and Heiji, along with the Osaka and Kyoto police departments, begin their investigation on the Satsuki Cup and the related murder case. As the inquiry goes on, they come across a secret connected with the Hyakunin Isshu."},"tags":[{"name":"Karuta","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Regression","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Butler","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Police","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Terrorism","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Detective","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":53,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Detective Conan: The Crimson Love Letter","english":"Detective Conan: The Crimson Love Letter","native":"名探偵コナン から紅の恋歌(ラブレター)","romaji":"Meitantei Conan: Kara Kurenai no Love Letter","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"名探偵コナン から紅の恋歌"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"名侦探柯南 殷红的恋歌"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"名侦探柯南剧场版M21"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"名侦探柯南 唐红的恋歌"}]},"trailer":{"id":"d44tuuPbAw8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/d44tuuPbAw8/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}